    - ``u``: left singular vectors of shape ``(..., N, N)`` if ``full_matrices`` is True
      or ``(..., N, K)`` otherwise.
    - ``s``: singular values of shape ``(..., K)``
    - ``vh``: conjugate-transposed right singular vectors of shape ``(..., M, M)``
      if ``full_matrices`` is True or ``(..., K, M)`` otherwise.

    where ``K = min(N, M)``.

